  "answer": "PowerToys doesn't have a screen translator yet. This request has been made many times. The maintainers track it in PowerToys#18014 (\"Instant translator\"), and they close new requests for on-screen, OCR or selected-text translation as duplicates of it. PowerToys#48830 and PowerToys#24843 ask for the same thing: select a screen region with a hotkey, run OCR, and show the translation in an overlay. Please subscribe to #18014 and add a thumbs-up and your use cases there instead of opening a new ticket. As a workaround, use the existing Text Extractor (OCR) to copy text, then paste it into a translator such as DeepL or Google Translate. You can also use a separate tool such as ShareX."
